  <model metaid="meta_pravastatin_kidney" id="pravastatin_kidney" name="Model for pravastatin elimination in the kidneys" substanceUnits="mmole" timeUnits="min" volumeUnits="litre" areaUnits="m2" lengthUnits="metre" extentUnits="mmole">
    <notes>
      <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <h1>Model for pravastatin elimination in the kidneys</h1>
        <p>Model for the renal excretion of pravastatin by glomerular filtration and
tubular secretion (OAT3), relative to the glomerular filtration rate,
encoded in <a href="http://sbml.org">SBML</a> format.</p>
        <p>The content of this model has been carefully created in a manual research effort.</p>
